  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 5723 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Our current losartan potassium supply is labeled with Aurobindo Pharma Limited as the manufacturing plant (FEI 3004021229).",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 684552 of that plant ended on 2010-09-24 and was classified Official Action Indicated (OAI).",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 5723 days before today's posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant's most recent inspection (1210950) ended on 2023-07-21 and was classified Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI).",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternative registered plant, APL HEALTHCARE LIMITED (FEI 3011895410), also manufactures this product and received a VAI classification on 2025-12-17.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 11 days of inventory on hand while Corvale General has 26 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to purchase from DIRECT RX, which is not on FDA's shortage list and whose plant last received an NAI classification on 2026-06-04.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
